<title>EGYPT: Maintenance schedule for Egyptian refineries.</title>
<headline>Maintenance schedule for Egyptian refineries.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maintenance for Egypt's six public sector crude refineries is scheduled so as not to affect the country's total throughput of crude, a senior official at the Egyptian General Petroleum Corp said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We distribute the work so that throughput is steady,&quot; the official, who declined to be named said.</p>
<p>Following is a schedule of partial shutdowns for the six Egyptian refining companies for 1997 provided by EGPC:</p>
<p>    REFINERY    DIST. UNIT	SHUTDOWN</p>
<p>Cairo</p>
<p>Mostorod unit (distillation units capacity 150,808 bpd)</p>
<p>		    unit 1	     April 1 to April 15</p>
<p>		    unit 2	     Dec   1 to Dec   15</p>
<p>		    unit 3	     Sept  1 to Sept  15</p>
<p>		    unit 4	     March 1 to March 15</p>
<p>		    platforming	May   1 to May   30</p>
<p>	Tanta unit   (distillation units capacity 44,700 bpd)</p>
<p>		    unit 1	     Jan   1 to Jan   15</p>
<p>		    unit 2	     Feb   1 to Feb   15</p>
<p>    Amreya    (distillation units capacity 64,120 bpd)</p>
<p>		    unit 3	     Jan   15 to Jan   21</p>
<p>		    unit 5	     April 15 to April 21</p>
<p>		    platforming	June  15 to June  30</p>
<p>    Suez	(distillation units capacity 60,300 bpd)</p>
<p>		    unit 1	     March 1 to March  15</p>
<p>		    unit 2	     April 1 to April 15</p>
<p>		    platforming	Jan   1 to Jan   15</p>
<p>		    vacuum dist unit Jan   1 to Jan   15</p>
<p>Alexandria (distillation units capacity 111,233 bpd)</p>
<p>		    unit 1	     June 1 to  June 20</p>
<p>		    unit 2	     Dec  1 to  Dec  20</p>
<p>		    unit 3	     July 1 to  July 20</p>
<p>		    vacuum dist unit June 1 to  June 15</p>
<p>Nasr</p>
<p>Suez unit  (capacity 93,342 bpd)</p>
<p>		    unit 1	     March 20 to April 10</p>
<p>Wadi Feiran (capacity 6,041 bpd)</p>
<p>		    unit 1	     May 1   to May 30</p>
<p>Assiut (distillation unit capacity 50,157 bpd)</p>
<p>		    unit 1	     Nov 1   to Nov 20</p>
<p>-- Miral Fahmy +202 578 3290/1</p>
